@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title repo-documentation — Impact, Canonical Ownership and Diagram Policy

start
:Run documentation impact check;

if (Documented behavior, architecture, interface,\nworkflow, dependency or diagram changed?) then (no)
  :Record no documentation change needed;
  stop
endif

:Find canonical owner document;

if (Owner exists?) then (yes)
  :Update canonical owner;
else (no)
  :Create one focused owner document;
endif

:Update README documentation router when needed;

if (A diagram materially improves understanding?) then (yes)
  :Choose appropriate PlantUML diagram type;
  :Write stable .puml beside owner document;
  :Render SVG from the same source;
  :Validate render and readability;
  :Embed SVG with descriptive alt text;
  :Link editable .puml source;
else (no)
  :Keep explanation in prose / tables;
endif

:Check duplicate facts and orphaned docs;
:Record documentation result in delivery evidence;
stop
@enduml
